      "author": "Ralph Roberts",
      "date_raw": "Wed, 3 Jan 2024 21:28:00 +0000",
      "body": "Experts,\nAs part of an optimization sequence using GAMESS the program runs a SCF optimization and exits without minimizes.\nI see that there is a continuous looping in the total energy for 1-200 iterations of the SCF sequence.\n$SYSTEM MEMDDI=400 MWORDS=125 $END\n$CONTRL DFTTYP=B3LYP RUNTYP=OPTIMIZE ICHARG=-2 MULT=1 MAXIT=200 $END\n$STATPT OPTTOL=0.0005 NSTEP=200 $END\n$BASIS GBASIS=N31 NGAUSS=6 NDFUNC=1 $END\n--------------------------\nR-B3LYP SCF CALCULATION\n-------------------------\nNUCLEAR ENERGY = 3025.0989435550\nMAXIT = 200 NPUNCH= 2\nEXTRAP=T DAMP=F SHIFT=F RSTRCT=F DIIS=T DEM=F SOSCF=F\nDENSITY MATRIX CONVERGENCE THRESHOLD= 1.00E-05\nCOARSE -> FINE DFT GRID SWITCH THRESHOLD= 3.00E-04 (SWITCH IN $DFT)\nHF -> DFT SWITCH THRESHOLD= 5.00E-03 (SWOFF IN $DFT)\nMEMORY REQUIRED FOR RHF ITERS= 2128387 WORDS.\nDFT CODE IS SWITCHING FROM THE FINE GRID NRAD= 96, NLEB= 302\nTO THE COARSE GRID NRAD0= 24, NLEB0= 110\nITER EX DEM TOTAL ENERGY E CHANGE DENSITY CHANGE DIIS ERROR\n160 4 0 -2507.7335541060 1460.9418997041 98.727786281 2.543210670\n161 5 0 -3767.3305524677 -1259.5969983617 98.727640174 6.416922407\n162 6 0 -2614.0638072193 1153.2667452483 92.702292342 1.597796118\n163 0 0 -3587.5691547522 -973.5053475328 85.737033646 6.261611431\n164 1 0 -4939.8077351986 -1352.2385804464 41.337522406 1.358624512\n165 2 0 -3782.4273190572 1157.3804161414 64.066361479 2.031788164\n166 3 0 -3968.6754538101 -186.2481347529 89.485563071 2.129968131\n167 4 0 -2507.7335541059 1460.9418997043 98.727786281 2.543210670\n168 5 0 -3767.3305524676 -1259.5969983618 98.727640175 6.416922407\n169 6 0 -2614.0638072193 1153.2667452484 92.702292341 1.597796118\n170 0 0 -3587.5691547523 -973.5053475330 85.737033645 6.261611430\n171 1 0 -4939.8077351986 -1352.2385804463 41.337522406 1.358624512\n172 2 0 -3782.4273190573 1157.3804161413 64.066361479 2.031788164\n173 3 0 -3968.6754538102 -186.2481347529 89.485563071 2.129968131\n174 4 0 -2507.7335541060 1460.9418997043 98.727786282